u(up)`, `down`, `combine` all bf16; only the
gate is bf16→fp8→bf16). The MoE block is a single `Op::MoeBlock` in the plan (the engine does not schedule the
internal ops; the block kernel does).

## NVFP4 GEMV (the hard kernel)

`kernels/cuda/nvfp4.cu` (registered by `crates/intarsia-backend-cuda/src/quantmoe.rs`):

* `nvfp4_gemv_splitk_v1`: split-K, 4
